    "notes": [
        {
            "title": "4th September 2019: Server maintenance for EMERGENCY 20 and EMERGENCY 4 Deluxe",
            "date": "2019-09-03 09:34:05",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2415540140474417147",
            "notes": "The EMERGENCY 4 and EMERGENCY 5, 2016, 2017 and 20 Multiplayer Matchmaking servers will undergo necessary maintenance starting on Wednesday, 4th September 2019.\r\n\r\nThey will be restarted multiple times, hindering online play. Playing in singleplayer will not be affected.\r\n\r\nRestarts and unstable matchmaking are to be expected in the following timeframe:\r\n\r\n12:00 - 00:00 PDT\r\n15:00 - 03:00 EDT\r\n19:00 - 07:00 UTC/GMT\r\n21:00 - 09:00 CEST\r\n\r\nThank you for your patience!\r\n\r\n"
        },
        {
            "title": "EMERGENCY 2 now available!",
            "date": "2018-11-28 09:57:49",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2415515408465691991",
            "notes": "[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33042176/560c305cf2588ceea490e64816e61bde52ebba38.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\nThe classic [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/977840/]EMERGENCY 2[/url] is now available as a digital download on Steam and compatible with modern operating systems!\r\n\r\nExperience some of the most iconic missions in the EMERGENCY franchise in gloriously detailed 2D. From a simple accident at a railway crossing to large scale disasters like a nuclear submarine on fire, EMERGENCY 2 offers a wide range of thrilling missions!\r\n\r\nTake command of your rescue base and see it get populated as you acquire new vehicles. Send your vehicles to mission sites and choose exactly what team you need to manage the job at hand.\r\n"
        },
        {
            "title": "EMERGENCY HQ is getting it's biggest update yet!",
            "date": "2018-11-16 09:35:38",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3316234163917822822",
            "notes": "[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33042176/1a2bb0ed7ab36291d4211af881ccb4bcb4331df5.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\n[b]Great new features coming in the Holiday Update![/b]\r\n\r\nEMERGENCY Land is getting ready for Winter! The weather forecast predicts snow and everyone is getting the decorations ready.\r\n\r\nIn the biggest update yet, your EMERGENCY Headquarters will be redecorated and there's lots to do. After all snow and ice pose new challenges.\r\n\r\nBut your EMERGENCY rescue team is prepared for everything!\r\n\r\nCelebrate the winter holiday season with us and lots of new content! The Update will not only bring snow and new decorations. More will be added than in any other expansion before!\r\n\r\nEMERGENCY HQ is our free2play mobile game, already available on iPhone, iPad and Android devices.\r\n\r\nDownload now:\r\n\r\nApple App Store: https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/emergency-hq/id859148736\r\n\r\nGoogle Play Store: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sgs.emhq.android"
        },
        {
            "title": "Server maintenance on August 8th/9th 2018",
            "date": "2018-08-07 02:15:57",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2451533424651616883",
            "notes": "[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33042176/6d493d25595bedb625291b6dbfa34e26696b55f0.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\n\r\nStarting on Wednesday (8th of August 2018) and ending on Thursday (9th of August 2018) necessary server maintenance will be performed. EMERGENCY 5, EMERGENCY 2016, EMERGENCY 2017 and EMERGENCY 20 will be affected. \r\n\r\nMultiplayer will only be reliably possible through direct connection or with opened ports and you will be unable to download patches.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMaintenance schedule:\r\n\r\n12:00 PM noon – 11:00 PM (PDT)\r\n\r\n07:00 PM – 06:00 AM (UTC)\r\n\r\n09:00 PM - 07:00 AM (CEST)\r\n\r\nOther games and services will not be affected by the maintenance."
        },
        {
            "title": "EMERGENCY CLASSICS now available",
            "date": "2017-12-19 04:18:30",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2442505391489747885",
            "notes": "[i]EMERGENCY 3 and EMERGENCY 2014 back at last[/i]\r\n\r\n[img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/31335512/e39017a046c2a51bb29172f00d85a530d94a1b41.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\nAt long last two classic EMERGENCY titles are available to download on Steam. Whether you never played these old favourites or whether you simply want to experience them again, EMERGENCY 3 and EMERGENCY 2014 offer thrilling EMERGENCY-Challenges for the Holiday season!\r\n\r\nEMERGENCY CLASSICS premieres EMERGENCY 3 on Steam! With this title the series made the jump to full 3D graphics and offers 20 tense missions.\r\n\r\nWith EMERGENCY 2014 all the content from EMERGENCY 2012 to 2014 is returning to Steam. Heat Waves, Volcanoes and even meteor showers, EMERGENCY 2014 will keep you busy with large-scale disasters. Please note that it might take a few hours until EMERGENCY 2014 is available to buy again.\r\n\r\n[url=http://store.steampowered.com/app/757200/] EMERGENCY 3 [/url]  costs 3,99€ or your regional equivalent and [url=http://store.steampowered.com/app/260930/]EMERGENCY 2014[/url] is available for 9,99€. During the first week you can get our classics for 10% off!\r\n"
        },
        {
            "title": "EMERGENCY CLASSICS now available",
            "date": "2017-12-19 04:18:30",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3819571572130860004",
            "notes": "[i]EMERGENCY 3 and EMERGENCY 2014 back at last[/i]\r\n\r\n[img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/31335512/e39017a046c2a51bb29172f00d85a530d94a1b41.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\nAt long last two classic EMERGENCY titles are available to download on Steam. Whether you never played these old favourites or whether you simply want to experience them again, EMERGENCY 3 and EMERGENCY 2014 offer thrilling EMERGENCY-Challenges for the Holiday season!\r\n\r\nEMERGENCY CLASSICS premieres EMERGENCY 3 on Steam! With this title the series made the jump to full 3D graphics and offers 20 tense missions.\r\n\r\nWith EMERGENCY 2014 all the content from EMERGENCY 2012 to 2014 is returning to Steam. Heat Waves, Volcanoes and even meteor showers, EMERGENCY 2014 will keep you busy with large-scale disasters. Please note that it might take a few hours until EMERGENCY 2014 is available to buy again.\r\n\r\n[url=http://store.steampowered.com/app/757200/] EMERGENCY 3 [/url]  costs 3,99€ or your regional equivalent and [url=http://store.steampowered.com/app/260930/]EMERGENCY 2014[/url] is available for 9,99€. During the first week you can get our classics for 10% off!\r\n"
        },
